{"id":"00315","root":"uni00315_1","name":{"ja":"秋山　凜子","en":"Akiyama Rinko"},"title":{"ja":"【制服の斬鬼】","en":"【Uniform Demon Slayer】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【制服の斬鬼】 秋山　凜子","en":"【Uniform Demon Slayer】 Akiyama Rinko"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-03-31","limited":true,"characterId":1,"profile":{"ja":"ゆきかぜの幼馴染で姉のような存在。秋山達郎は弟。太刀の使い手。忍の里に代々伝わる剣術『逸刀流』の皆伝。“斬鬼の対魔忍”と恐れられる手練の美しき剣客。常にゆきかぜと行動をともにし、彼女を献身的にサポートしている。学園では強く美しく厳しい先輩として見られていて、数多の男子の求愛にまったく興味を示さない。女子生徒の中でも絶大な人気があり、秘かに凜子様ファンクラブなるものが存在し強い広がりを見せている。特に春先は凜子の制服姿に見とれた新入生がそのままファンクラブに入会し、一気に会員数が増えるらしい。入学して戸惑う新入生に先輩として声をかける凜子の優しさも相まって、会員数はさらに増加の一途を辿る。制服については清潔感があり動きやすいと凜子自身も気に入っているらしい。","en":"(Akiyama Rinko, she/her) She is Mizuki Yukikaze's childhood friend and something of an older sister to her, while Akiyama Tatsuro is her younger brother. A master of the tachi, she holds the full transmission of the sword style \"Ittou-ryu,\" a technique passed down through generations of the ninja village. Feared as the \"Demon-slaying Taimanin,\" she is a skilled and beautiful swordswoman. She constantly stays by Yukikaze's side, offering devoted support. At the Academy she is regarded as a strong, beautiful, and strict senior, showing no interest in the countless male admirers who pursue her. Among the female students she enjoys overwhelming popularity, and a secret \"Lady Rinko fan club\" has quietly flourished. In early spring, new students who are captivated by Rinko's uniform often join the club on the spot, causing membership to surge. Rinko's kindness in greeting bewildered freshmen as a senior further fuels the club's rapid growth. She herself seems to like her uniform, finding it clean-looking and easy to move in."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00315_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1272,2544],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[156,312],"def":[142,284],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","5300